unknown
v1_0.m is an integer computed by v0_0.n + 1, in [-inf, +inf], which the checker cannot show within int64 and the target's int32; bound the fields it reads (int32, >=0 & <=100) (rule unknown-bounds) @ lens.cue:2:11
